  "title": "RailPulse™ Brings Real-Time Visibility to Customers",
  "summary": "RailPulse™ is a telematics platform that provides real-time visibility into railcar location, condition and performance. By delivering secure, standardized data, RailPulse™ helps railroads, shippers and fleet owners improve asset tracking, operational efficiency and supply chain coordination across the North American rail network.",
